sequenceDiagram
    actor C as User or External Consumer
    participant UI as Angular Web UI / API Client
    participant EDGE as API Edge
    participant AUTH as Authorization Policy Service
    participant QAPI as Query API
    participant QRES as Query Resolver
    participant QREP as Query Repository
    participant QREAD as Query Read Store

    C->>UI: Request prices for hotel/date
    UI->>EDGE: Query prices
    EDGE->>AUTH: Validate token and route access
    AUTH-->>EDGE: Allowed
    EDGE->>QAPI: Forward query
    QAPI->>AUTH: Validate hotel-level permission
    AUTH-->>QAPI: Authorized
    QAPI->>QRES: Resolve prices
    QRES->>QREP: Load current published prices
    QREP->>QREAD: Read prices
    QREAD-->>QREP: Price data
    QREP-->>QRES: Price data
    QRES-->>QAPI: Query result
    QAPI-->>EDGE: Response
    EDGE-->>UI: Prices returned